{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wLyBwFMg6w1795413464.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西半山明苑分行高級資深分區營業經理譚嘉良表示，分行新近促成西半山蔚華閣租賃成交，單位為低層A室，實用面積687平方呎，採1房1套間隔，望內街景，最新以1,028萬元成交，折合實用呎價14,964元。</p><p><br/>譚嘉良表示，新買家為同區客，心儀上址位處半山地段，且居住環境舒適寧靜，遂決定入市。據了解，原業主於2002年以337萬元購入單位，持貨24年，是次轉手賬面獲利691萬元，單位升值逾2倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:03:52.014965+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:37:13.981994+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T09:57:16.681120+00:00","content_hash":"f6c1d97a151ec85fa8e5767176aef629ac24c7f45fde7007ab6b7357e6ee356f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:03:52.014965+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}